Install instructions:

1.  Install Unity Hub
2.  Open Unity Hub and sign in
3.  Skip past the Editor installs
4.  Go to installs tab, click Install Editor
5.  Download "Unity 6.3 LTS (6000.3.18f1)" Move to the next step while this downloads
6.  Go to GitHub.com
9.  Sign in to GitHub
10. Go to https://github.com/Eureka57vette/Project-Daedelus-Concept-001
11. Clone HTTPS of Project-Daedelus-Concept-001 (https://github.com/Eureka57vette/Project-Daedelus-Concept-001.git)
12. Download Git Bash at https://git-scm.com/install/windows and hit click "Click here to download"
13. Search in windows search bar "Git CMD"
14. Open Git CMD
15. Type in the command line interface: git clone https://github.com/Eureka57vette/Project-Daedelus-Concept-001.git
16. Go back to Unity hub and wait for Unity 6.3 to download.
17. There should be a popup to download Visual Studio, if you don't see it check the task bar for the Visual Studio app (the app icon is purple)
18. Download Visual Studio in Unity
19. Scroll down and select "Game Development with Unity"
20. Install, then sign in with GitHub
21. Select "open a local folder"
22. Choose C:\Users\Thrive Student\Project-Daedelus-Concept-001
23. In Unity Hub go to projects folder
24. Click add then add from disk
25. Select C:\Users\Thrive Student\Project-Daedelus-Concept-001

For Questions contact Natalie at nataliehfreeman@gmail.com
Please send screenshots with your questions.
